# Scratch Remotion scaffold — a SEPARATE git repository (its own .git), 619MB of
# which 612MB is node_modules. `git add` would record it as a broken gitlink
# pointing at a repo with no remote; force-adding its files would drag the
# node_modules tree into history. It is not part of this application — the root
# ESLint config already ignores it (`my-video/**`).
my-video/

# Supabase CLI scratch (version-check cache, linked-project state)
supabase/.temp/
